     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Answering my own question<div><br></div><div>Using aes(fill= ...) and scale_fill_manual allows to do what I want</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">productplots</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">magrittr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>titanicdf </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Titanic</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>titanicdf </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#000\">prodplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Freq</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Survived</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Class</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;vspine&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hspine&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hspine&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Survived</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    scale_fill_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;darkred&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;darkgreen&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div></div>"
